{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/954293-anarchy-new-age-and-satanistic-unicorns","id":954293,"title":"Anarchy, New Age and Satanistic Unicorns","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-20T03:32:44-07:00","id":954293,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon6.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Anarchy, New Age and Satanistic Unicorns","content":"So one of my players wants for her character 'Anarchy, New Age and Satanistic Unicorns' as Order - I first thought about Free Council on that idea, but I'm not sure is it still valid point in 2E. Democracy do not foster Anarchy and Satanistic Unicorns can be new Exarchs. Still, New Age have probably strong Nameless vibes. What do you think on the matter?<br /> <br /> Best would be appropriate media to convey this image of group you are thinking about. Yes, I want as close picture ( or other ) to this statement.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-20T04:30:48-07:00","id":954302,"title":"","content":"Is that a reference to something?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Democracy do not foster Anarchy </div> </div> </div>Depends what you mean by anarchy. If you mean general chaos and disorder then not really. But if you mean the political ideology, they'r